{"sha": "20f13675f5057d4e5b1dc8bbda887710b4255573f5e5281b2439923a25c0d9a6", "body": ["\\chapter{磁铁}\\label{ch:g1:magnets}", "", "冰箱门上，几个小人儿举着图画，", "不用胶水，不用胶带，也不用挂钩。拔下一个，背面毫无黏性 ---", "可它却弹回去，牢牢吸住。", "这些小人儿里都藏着一块磁铁。磁铁大有奇妙之处，", "值得用整整一章的实验去探索。", "", "\\section{磁铁能吸住什么}", "", "\\begin{definition}[磁铁]\\label{def:g1:magnets:magnet}", "\\emph{磁铁}\\index{磁铁}是一种特殊的石块或金属，", "它不必接触，就能把某些东西吸向自己。", "磁铁会\\emph{吸引}\\index{吸引}它们。被它吸引的东西会贴上来；", "其余的则对它毫不在意。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[动手试一试：抓取测试]\\label{ex:g1:magnets:test}", "拿着磁铁在家里走一走，逐一试试：回形针、", "钉子、冰箱门、木勺、塑料积木、", "一张纸、玻璃杯、软木塞。磁铁能吸住回形针、", "钉子和冰箱门 --- 对其余的东西一概不理。", "只有一部分东西会被磁铁吸引。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  % bar magnet, two colored ends", "  \\draw[thick, fill=red!70] (0.2,1.15) rectangle (0.95,1.85);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=blue!60] (0.95,1.15) rectangle (1.7,1.85);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.95,1.0) {磁铁};", "  % paperclip, rushing in", "  \\begin{scope}[shift={(2.75,2.0)}]", "    \\draw[thick, rounded corners=2.6pt]", "      (0,0) -- (1.1,0) -- (1.1,0.42) -- (0.12,0.42) -- (0.12,0.14)", "      -- (0.95,0.14) -- (0.95,0.30) -- (0.30,0.30);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\draw[-Stealth, very thick, omThm] (2.6,1.95) -- (1.95,1.85);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (4.1,2.2) {回形针：吸住了！};", "  % nail, rushing in", "  \\begin{scope}[shift={(2.55,0.55)}]", "    \\draw[thick, fill=omExo!35] (0,0.16) -- (0.4,0.06) -- (1.5,0.06)", "      -- (1.5,0.26) -- (0.4,0.26) -- cycle;", "    \\draw[thick, fill=omExo!55] (1.5,-0.02) rectangle (1.62,0.34);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\draw[-Stealth, very thick, omThm] (2.4,0.85) -- (1.85,1.05);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (4.35,0.7) {钉子：吸住了！};", "  % cork, not interested", "  \\begin{scope}[shift={(8.3,1.55)}]", "    \\draw[thick, fill=brown!40] (0,0) -- (0.07,0.62) -- (0.63,0.62)", "      -- (0.7,0) -- cycle;", "    \\draw[thick, fill=brown!25] (0.35,0.62) ellipse (0.28 and 0.09);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (9.35,1.85) {软木塞：无动于衷};", "  % plastic brick, not interested", "  \\begin{scope}[shift={(8.2,0.3)}]", "    \\draw[thick, fill=yellow!70] (0,0) rectangle (1.0,0.5);", "    \\draw[thick, fill=yellow!50] (0,0.5) -- (0.25,0.72) -- (1.25,0.72)", "      -- (1.0,0.5) -- cycle;", "    \\draw[thick, fill=yellow!45] (1.0,0) -- (1.25,0.22) -- (1.25,0.72)", "      -- (1.0,0.5) -- cycle;", "    \\draw[thick, fill=yellow!80] (0.42,0.61) ellipse (0.13 and 0.055);", "    \\draw[thick, fill=yellow!80] (0.86,0.61) ellipse (0.13 and 0.055);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (9.7,0.55) {塑料积木：};", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (9.7,0.15) {无动于衷};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 抓取测试：回形针和钉子冲向磁铁；", "软木塞和塑料积木仍停在原处。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[磁铁最爱的金属]\\label{ex:g1:magnets:iron}", "看看被吸住的东西：回形针、钉子、冰箱门。", "它们都是用\\emph{铁}（或者钢，钢主要也是铁）做的。", "木头、塑料、纸、玻璃、石头：一律不吸。", "还有个有趣的发现：有些\\emph{金属}也会被忽略 ---", "试试一枚硬币或一片厨房铝箔。磁铁并非“爱金属”，", "而是“爱铁”。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{磁铁的作用范围}", "", "\\begin{example}[动手试一试：隔着东西吸]\\label{ex:g1:magnets:through}", "把一枚回形针放在桌上，再把磁铁拿到桌子\\emph{下方}，", "紧贴回形针正下方。移动磁铁，回形针就会", "在桌面上滑来滑去，仿佛施了魔法 --- 磁力直接穿过了木头。", "它也能穿过纸、硬纸板，", "甚至一杯水：把回形针丢进杯中，", "用磁铁沿杯壁慢慢移上来，手指保持干燥。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  % stand with a thread", "  \\draw[very thick] (1.1,3.6) -- (3.7,3.6);", "  \\draw[very thick] (1.1,3.6) -- (0.5,2.3);", "  \\draw[very thick] (3.7,3.6) -- (4.3,2.3);", "  \\node[above, font=\\small] at (2.4,3.68) {支架、细线};", "  \\draw (2.4,3.6) -- (2.4,1.55);", "  % paperclip hanging from the thread, straining down", "  \\begin{scope}[shift={(2.19,1.55)}, rotate=-90]", "    \\draw[thick, rounded corners=2.6pt]", "      (0,0) -- (1.1,0) -- (1.1,0.42) -- (0.12,0.42) -- (0.12,0.14)", "      -- (0.95,0.14) -- (0.95,0.30) -- (0.30,0.30);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (1.75,1.0) {回形针};", "  % the air gap, made visible", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, thick, omThm] (2.4,0.38) -- (2.4,0.02);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small, omThm] at (2.62,0.2) {空气间隙！};", "  % the magnet below", "  \\draw[thick, fill=red!70] (1.5,-0.62) rectangle (2.4,-0.02);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=blue!60] (2.4,-0.62) rectangle (3.3,-0.02);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2.4,-0.72) {磁铁};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}